OL,3,ABBC shelves plans for new Archers
OL,4,Astudio as part of cost-cutting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has shelved plans to build a
OL,7,Fnew bespoke studio for The Archers in
OL,8,FBirmingham as part of its wider drive
OL,9,Fto cut costs, opening up the
OL,10,Fpossibility that the Radio 4's series
OL,11,Fcould be recorded outside the city for
OL,12,Fthe first time.
OL,14,FThe world's longest-running soap opera,
OL,15,FThe Archers has been recording in the
OL,16,FWest Midlands city for 75 years.
OL,18,FThe BBC had initially pledged to build
OL,19,Fthe show a new studio in the Tea
OL,20,FFactory, the corporation's new hub in
OL,21,FDigbeth, central Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
