OL,3,ABBC shelves plans for new Archers
OL,4,Astudio as part of cost-cutting
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the broadcaster said it was
OL,7,F"currently assessing the BBC's existing
OL,8,Fstudio facilities around the UK as well
OL,9,Fas other external studio options in the
OL,10,FWest Midlands".
